343: **Planning estimate:** 12 fly arms (the ten graph arms of section 7.2 plus the diary at capacities one sixteenth and every lesson) � 3 runs; with the all-legal measure only on the diary, no-diary and learning-off arms, that is about 229,000 forward passes (about 35 legal moves per all-legal board), or about 24 hours in one process at the v8 rate of 0.375 s per pass; about 6-7 hours with 4 workers, which fits the 2,048 MiB budget at the 245-299 MiB peaks measured in v8 and the cubic run. The dry run measures the real figure.
