401:| Skeptic 1: margins hide losses; refresh rival; all-legal had no threshold | Kept-share rule; low-point snapshots and sawtooth log; all-legal threshold |
420:3. Moved-timing replays are placed after the earlier block's test snapshot, so that snapshot is comparable across arms.
438:2. **Unknown boards could manufacture an all-legal advantage** (required). Every eligible board now stays in the denominator, and comparisons must survive the worst case for the diary (its unknowns score 0, the other arm's score 1).
